The true/ and false/ JSON files are unmodified reference vectors from
SapientServicesValidator.UnitTests/{True,False}. manifest.json records SHA-256
hashes. The Rust validator is an attributed port of SapientServices/Data/Validation,
not a clean-room implementation. Local adaptation and tests are described in
../../README.md. The corpus verifies reference-vector verdicts, not all possible
messages or a production SAPIENT controller's behavior.
